{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime 64 is a 3D collect-a-thon platformer featuring elemental slimes who collect assorted Bells &amp; Whistles, and who combine their powers to save the world from a Diabolical Robotic Enterprise. Inspired by retro classics, the game places heavy emphasis on exploration, schmoovement, and on creating a world filled with wacky, memorable characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll across obstacles as Tuff, the Earth slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/bbcf1376be4897526a120d31fda2c087.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Tuff, the Earth Slime - he turns into a solid boulder (with large googly eyes) and rolls through the world at high speeds, destroying weak walls in his path.\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/bbcf1376be4897526a120d31fda2c087.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/bbcf1376be4897526a120d31fda2c087.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash and weave through hazards as Ash, the Fire slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/1dfe5059b41367f3196e065915ac602b.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Ash, the Fire Slime - they use the flames inside of them to perform a fire dash and a double jump, allowing for precise movements through hostile terrain.\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/1dfe5059b41367f3196e065915ac602b.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/1dfe5059b41367f3196e065915ac602b.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the skies as Winona, the Air slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/543a072488c3ee9dba9b301d5434310f.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Winona, the Air Slime - She glides through the skies by guiding the winds, and can even fly upwards for a limited time.\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/543a072488c3ee9dba9b301d5434310f.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/543a072488c3ee9dba9b301d5434310f.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and cruise around at high speeds as Marsh, the Water slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/0caa2ff400269efdf45c49c6760b1015.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Marsh, the Water Slime - he propels himself at high speeds by shooting out a jetstream of water. Careful steering is required!\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/0caa2ff400269efdf45c49c6760b1015.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/0caa2ff400269efdf45c49c6760b1015.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help these Slimes journey across the world thwarting the diabolical Wurltson's evil plans and dismantling his ever-expanding robotic enterprise. The Golden Keys, and assorted Bells and Whistles, will unlock new worlds to explore as you amass your strength in numbers (and your pile of goodies).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/837a2ef08b828d25aa54eef8293253e4.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Wurltson, the diabolical robot. His head is a top hat with angry eyes and a crooked grin, which levitates above a metal body. He also has detatched hands and strange screw he uses in lieu of legs.\" width=1000 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/837a2ef08b828d25aa54eef8293253e4.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/837a2ef08b828d25aa54eef8293253e4.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a Visual Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people prefer jaggy edges and scanlines, others prefer crystal clear sight. Play the game with visuals set to Nostalgia, HD Remaster, or <i>Crunchy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Soundtrack</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy tunes inspired by the style and tone of yesteryear combined with some smart programming help capture that classic exploration feel.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1562410?t=1763600158","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1562410?t=1763600158","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763600158","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763600158","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1566140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime 64 is a 3D collect-a-thon platformer featuring elemental slimes who collect assorted Bells &amp; Whistles, and who combine their powers to save the world from a Diabolical Robotic Enterprise. Inspired by retro classics, the game places heavy emphasis on exploration, schmoovement, and on creating a world filled with wacky, memorable characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll across obstacles as Tuff, the Earth slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/bbcf1376be4897526a120d31fda2c087.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Tuff, the Earth Slime - he turns into a solid boulder (with large googly eyes) and rolls through the world at high speeds, destroying weak walls in his path.\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/bbcf1376be4897526a120d31fda2c087.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/bbcf1376be4897526a120d31fda2c087.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash and weave through hazards as Ash, the Fire slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/1dfe5059b41367f3196e065915ac602b.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Ash, the Fire Slime - they use the flames inside of them to perform a fire dash and a double jump, allowing for precise movements through hostile terrain.\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/1dfe5059b41367f3196e065915ac602b.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/1dfe5059b41367f3196e065915ac602b.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the skies as Winona, the Air slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/543a072488c3ee9dba9b301d5434310f.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Winona, the Air Slime - She glides through the skies by guiding the winds, and can even fly upwards for a limited time.\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/543a072488c3ee9dba9b301d5434310f.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/543a072488c3ee9dba9b301d5434310f.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and cruise around at high speeds as Marsh, the Water slime:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/0caa2ff400269efdf45c49c6760b1015.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Marsh, the Water Slime - he propels himself at high speeds by shooting out a jetstream of water. Careful steering is required!\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/0caa2ff400269efdf45c49c6760b1015.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/0caa2ff400269efdf45c49c6760b1015.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help these Slimes journey across the world thwarting the diabolical Wurltson's evil plans and dismantling his ever-expanding robotic enterprise. The Golden Keys, and assorted Bells and Whistles, will unlock new worlds to explore as you amass your strength in numbers (and your pile of goodies).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/837a2ef08b828d25aa54eef8293253e4.poster.avif?t=1763600158\" aria-label=\"Wurltson, the diabolical robot. His head is a top hat with angry eyes and a crooked grin, which levitates above a metal body. He also has detatched hands and strange screw he uses in lieu of legs.\" width=1000 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/837a2ef08b828d25aa54eef8293253e4.webm?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/extras/837a2ef08b828d25aa54eef8293253e4.mp4?t=1763600158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a Visual Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some people prefer jaggy edges and scanlines, others prefer crystal clear sight. Play the game with visuals set to Nostalgia, HD Remaster, or <i>Crunchy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Soundtrack</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy tunes inspired by the style and tone of yesteryear combined with some smart programming help capture that classic exploration feel.</p>","developers":["WaveParadigm","Slime Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562410/header.jpg?t=1763600158","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Slime 64 (C) WaveParadigm LLC All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> &gt;= 1.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any from the last 10 years<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.6+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> &gt;= 1.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any from the last 5 years<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1562410/175259189/3005d1f2195f8a1f56b09a7986e3b97db8a29090/1757141561/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757182451","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1562410/175259189/3005d1f2195f8a1f56b09a7986e3b97db8a29090/1757141561/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757182451","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1562410/175259189/3005d1f2195f8a1f56b09a7986e3b97db8a29090/1757141561/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757182451","id":257193899,"name":"Reveal Trailer","thu